{"id":"method-parity-definition","html":"<section class=\"contract\" id=\"contract\"><h2>什么时候用</h2><dl><dt>适合什么题</dt><dd>一个来源明确的具体函数，及题给定义域或输入范围（如有）。</dd><dt>最后要得到什么</dt><dd>奇性、偶性各自的证明或反例，以及奇函数、偶函数、既奇又偶、非奇非偶四类结论之一。</dd><dt>要注意</dt><dd>先保留原式的分母、根式与分段限制，求出实际定义域。定义域不对称时，两项性质都不成立；对称时，在每个区间和孤立点上分别核对奇性与偶性。绝对值要按符号化简，分段函数要检查相反输入各自落在哪一段。无法完成证明时不下结论，不当作非奇非偶。</dd></dl></section><section id=\"path\"><h2>解题步骤</h2><p class=\"muted\">按顺序做。标了条件的技能，只在题目符合那个条件时才用。</p><ol class=\"method-path\" aria-label=\"解题步骤\"><li id=\"prepare\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><h3>整理函数</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#prepare\" aria-label=\"定位到整理函数\">#</a></div><p>保存原式、题给定义域及其角色，不预先约分。</p></li><li id=\"domain\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><h3>确定定义域</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#domain\" aria-label=\"定位到确定定义域\">#</a></div><p>借用列条件求交集法求自然定义域，再与题给范围取交。</p><div class=\"step-calls is-inline\"><p class=\"rel-label\">这一步用到</p><ul><li><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"method\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-domain-intersection/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>列条件求交集法</a></li></ul></div></li><li id=\"symmetry\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><h3>检查定义域的对称性</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#symmetry\" aria-label=\"定位到检查定义域的对称性\">#</a></div><p>比较 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span>；</span>不对称时给出一个 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t\\in D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6542em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span> 而 <span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-t\\notin D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span></span><span class=\"mord katex-vbox\"><span class=\"katex-thinbox\"><span class=\"llap\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"katex-fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span>。</span></p><div class=\"step-calls is-inline\"><p class=\"rel-label\">这一步用到</p><ul><li><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"skill\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/skill-domain-symmetry/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>检查定义域的对称性</a></li></ul></div></li><li id=\"reflect\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><h3>代入相反数</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#reflect\" aria-label=\"定位到代入相反数\">#</a></div><p>把 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span> 作为整体代入原式，得到 <span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(-x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。</span></p><div class=\"step-calls is-inline\"><p class=\"rel-label\">这一步用到</p><ul><li><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"method\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-function-evaluation/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>代入法</a></li></ul></div></li><li id=\"compare\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">5</span><h3>比较两条关系</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#compare\" aria-label=\"定位到比较两条关系\">#</a></div><p>在整个定义域上分别核对 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(-x)=-f(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(-x)=f(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>；</span>不成立时给出一个具体输入。</p><div class=\"step-calls is-inline\"><p class=\"rel-label\">这一步用到</p><ul><li><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"skill\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/skill-simplify/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>代数式化简</a></li></ul></div></li><li id=\"conclude\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">6</span><h3>得出结论</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#conclude\" aria-label=\"定位到得出结论\">#</a></div><p>两项性质都有依据后，才归入四类结论之一。</p></li><li id=\"verify\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">7</span><h3>核验奇偶性结论</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#verify\" aria-label=\"定位到核验奇偶性结论\">#</a></div><p>独立重建定义域，逐项核对对称性、恒等证明或反例以及四类归属。</p></li></ol></section><section id=\"basis\"><h2>背后用到的知识</h2><p class=\"muted\">上面各步骤用到的性质和公式。做一道具体的题，通常只用到其中一部分。</p><div class=\"chips\"><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/equality-properties/#addition\">等式的性质 · 同加同减</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/equality-properties/#identity\">等式的性质 · 等值替换与定义域</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/equality-properties/#multiplication\">等式的性质 · 同乘与非零同除</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/function-graph-symmetry/#paired-arguments\">函数图像的对称性 · 从两个自变量的和找对称位置</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/function-parity/#domain\">函数的奇偶性 · 先看定义域能否成对</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/inequality-properties/#addition\">不等式的性质 · 同加减与同向相加</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/inequality-properties/#multiplication\">不等式的性质 · 乘除与方向</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/inequality-properties/#reciprocal\">不等式的性质 · 同号两数取倒数</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/integer-power/#positive-exponent\">整数幂 · 正整数次幂</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/integer-power/#zero-exponent\">整数幂 · 零次幂与底数限制</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/quadratic-equation/#discriminant\">一元二次方程 · 判别式与实根</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/quadratic-equation/#roots\">一元二次方程 · 求根公式</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/quadratic-equation/#vieta\">一元二次方程 · 根与系数及因式分解</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/rational-expression/#meaning\">分式 · 有意义与值为零</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/real-order/#difference\">不等式与实数大小关系 · 作差判号</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/square-root-expression/#meaning\">二次根式 · 有意义的条件与算术平方根</a></div></section><section id=\"examples\"><h2>例题</h2><article class=\"example\"><h3>1. 奇函数的判定</h3><p class=\"problem\">判断 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=\\dfrac{x}{x^2+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.8769em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span> 的奇偶性。</p><ol><li><span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+1&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span>，</span>定义域为 <span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6889em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span></span></span></span>，</span>关于原点对称。</li><li><span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><mat